OL,3,GNEWSAFilmmaker shining spotlight on
OL,4,A'living heritage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA filmmaker says he wants people to
OL,7,Fappreciate a region's "living heritage"
OL,8,Finvolving people as much as its
OL,9,Fhistoric sites and artefacts.
OL,11,FFilmmaker Dave Brewis has been
OL,12,Fcapturing traditional celebrations
OL,13,Facross Northumberland for his upcoming
OL,14,Findependent film "Gatherings", which he
OL,15,Fexpects to first show at Tyne Valley
OL,16,FFilm Festival in March.
OL,18,FThe unnarrated documentary style film
OL,19,Fbegan filming at the start of the year,
OL,20,Fwith Brewis planning on attending
OL,21,Fdifferent events until the end of the
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
